{"id":"7e9b1f3627a9d873","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-semiseparable.md","title":"Semi-separative Poset","display":"df-semiseparable — Semi-separative Poset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-semiseparable","aliases":["58-df-semiseparable","Semi-separative Poset"],"display":"df-semiseparable — Semi-separative Poset","depends_on":["[[58-df-poset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-semiseparable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-semiseparable</span><span>Semi-separative Poset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-semiseparable — Semi-separative Poset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq\\;\\subseteq P\\times P\">\\(\\leq\\;\\subseteq P\\times P\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Semisep}_S(P,\\leq)\">\\(\\mathrm{Semisep}_S(P,\\leq)\\)</span>（本文件定义的半分离偏序谓词；保留旧符号根以兼容文件 label）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semiseparable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Semisep}_S(P,\\leq)\n\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)\\land\n\\forall p\\in P\\;\\left(\n\\left[\\neg\\exists q\\in P\\;(q\\leq p\\land q\\neq p)\\right]\n\\lor\n\\exists q,r\\in P\\;\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;q\\leq p\\land q\\neq p\\land r\\leq p\\land r\\neq p\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\neg\\exists s\\in P\\;(s\\leq q\\land s\\leq r)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\n\\right)\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semiseparable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Semisep}_S(P,\\leq)\n\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)\\land\n\\forall p\\in P\\;\\left(\n\\left[\\neg\\exists q\\in P\\;(q\\leq p\\land q\\neq p)\\right]\n\\lor\n\\exists q,r\\in P\\;\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;q\\leq p\\land q\\neq p\\land r\\leq p\\land r\\neq p\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\neg\\exists s\\in P\\;(s\\leq q\\land s\\leq r)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\n\\right)\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>半分离偏序中，每个非极小条件都有两个互不相容的严格加强；序关系是谓词的显式参数。</li>\n<li>旧断言“每个小于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 的任意子集都有共同下界”会迫使所有小子集相容，它既不是标准闭性（闭性只量化下降链）也不是半分离性。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-poset","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-poset","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)$（see [[58-df-poset]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq\\;\\subseteq P\\times P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Semisep}_S(P,\\leq)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semiseparable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Semisep}_S(P,\\leq)\n\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)\\land\n\\forall p\\in P\\;\\left(\n\\left[\\neg\\exists q\\in P\\;(q\\leq p\\land q\\neq p)\\right]\n\\lor\n\\exists q,r\\in P\\;\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&q\\leq p\\land q\\neq p\\land r\\leq p\\land r\\neq p\\\\\n&{}\\land\\neg\\exists s\\in P\\;(s\\leq q\\land s\\leq r)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\n\\right)\n\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":1224,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1134","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-semiseparable.md|58-df-semiseparable]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["d3f859dbdd37f018"]}